> 
> So the executor expects `tool_name` / `tool_version`, but the manifest does not contain them.
> 
> ## Fix
> 
> Add the registered tool identity to each manifest entry:
> 
> ```python
> # planner/javascript/api.py
> 
> tools.append({
>     "name": name,
>     "tool_name": spec.name,
>     "tool_version": spec.version,
>     "description": spec.description,
>     "arguments": dict(js.get("arguments", {})),
>     "returns": js.get("returns", "json"),
