> def javascript_tools(registry: Registry) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:
>     # internal executor manifest: includes tool_name/tool_version
>     ...
> 
> def javascript_tool_manifest(registry: Registry) -> list[dict[str, Any]]:
>     # prompt-facing manifest
>     return [
>         {
>             "name": tool["name"],
>             "description": tool["description"],
>             "arguments": tool["arguments"],
>             "returns": tool["returns"],
>         }
>         for tool in javascript_tools(registry)
>     ]
> ```
> 
> Then in `javascript_prompt()` use `javascript_tool_manifest(registry)`, while the runtime uses `javascript_tools(registry)`.
> 
